 "note": "Memorial Park after the 2019 Tom Doak renovation (OpenGolfAPI card). Pars equal the OSM hole ways 1-18 (5 3 5 4 4 4 3 5 3 / 4 3 4 4 5 3 5 4 4 = 72) on all 18, and Blue is 0-34 yds longer than each OSM back-box line in OSM order, so the OSM order is kept. The golfify card the build tried is the pre-2019 layout (par 4 on 3 and 9, par 5 on 13): rejected, rightly. Hole-row sums kept as totals: the API's stated totals differ (Blue 7,292 vs 7,464 summed; White 6,553/6,584; Gold 5,905/5,930; Red 4,826/4,851). Green left out (stated 5,399 vs 5,595 summed, and its holes copy Gold's on 8 holes).",
